; A component a cost spec repeats is reported and ignored, but its amount
; still counts towards display precision.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 * "kept"
  Assets:A   20.00 USD
  Assets:B  -20.00 USD

2020-01-03 * "repeated cost"
  Assets:B   1 HOOL {{1 USD, 3 USD}}
  Assets:B   1 HOOL {1 USD, 3 USD}
  Assets:B
